# The toolchain (prettier endOfLine:lf, the miniapp packer and the SQL fixtures)
# requires LF. Without eol=lf a Windows checkout produces CRLF for .ts/.tsx/.md
# and check:format reports every file as unformatted, which makes the local gate
# useless and hides real drift.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.wxml text eol=lf
*.wxss text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
